==German==

===Etymology===
[[Upper German]] short form for now archaic {{m|de|Dachshund}}, from {{m|de|Dachs|t=badger}} + {{m|de|Hund|t=dog, hound}}, from the use of the breed for hunting badgers. First attested in the 19th century, but perhaps older; see {{m|de|Teckel}}.

